      "associationCertaintyURI": "https://pleiades.stoa.org/vocabularies/association-certainty/certain",
      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p><em>Cez\u0101\u2019ir-i \u1e2a\u0101lid\u0101t</em>:\u00a0Among these (islands) are the <em>Cez\u0101\u2019ir-i \u1e2a\u0101lid\u0101t</em>, which consist of two islands. On each of them stand two idols, each one a hundred cubits tall. They are fashioned from bronze. It has been written earlier that they are the workmanship of <em>\u1e94\u00fc\u2019l-men\u0101r-\u0131 a\u1e25mer</em> (the Possessor of the Red Lighthouse/Minaret). Another name for these is the <em>Cez\u0101\u2019ir\u00fc\u2019s-Su\u2018ed\u0101</em>.\u00a0According to what is written in the <em data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"560\">Ta\u1e33v\u012bm\u00fc\u2019l-b\u00fcld\u0101n</em>, however, the <em>Cez\u0101\u2019ir\u00fc\u2019s-Su\u2018ed\u0101t</em> are twenty-four islands. [translation]</p>",
      "review_state": "published",
      "description": "",
