      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>Cez\u0101\u2019ir-i \u1e2a\u0101lid\u0101t</em>:\u00a0<span>Among these (islands) are the\u00a0</span><em>Cez\u0101\u2019ir-i \u1e2a\u0101lid\u0101t</em><span>, which consist of two islands. On each of them stand two idols, each one a hundred cubits tall. They are fashioned from bronze. It has been written earlier that they are the workmanship of\u00a0</span><em>\u1e94\u00fc\u2019l-men\u0101r-\u0131 a\u1e25mer</em><span>\u00a0(the Possessor of the Red Lighthouse/Minaret). Another name for these is the\u00a0</span><em>Cez\u0101\u2019ir\u00fc\u2019s-Su\u2018ed\u0101</em><span>.\u00a0According to what is written in the\u00a0</span><em data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"560\">Ta\u1e33v\u012bm\u00fc\u2019l-b\u00fcld\u0101n</em><span>, however, the\u00a0</span><em>Cez\u0101\u2019ir\u00fc\u2019s-Su\u2018ed\u0101t</em><span>\u00a0are twenty-four islands. [translation]</span></p>",
